  "notes": "Compound of {冷|れい} (cold) + {凍|とう} (freeze). One of the most common everyday words related to food storage.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {冷凍|れいとう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to freeze)\n- {冷凍|れいとう}{食品|しょくひん} (frozen food)\n- {冷凍|れいとう}{庫|こ} (freezer)\n- {冷凍|れいとう}⟦{保存|ほぞん}→保存：03626_hozon⟧ (frozen storage)\n- {冷凍|れいとう}{餃子|ギョーザ} (frozen gyoza)\n- {冷凍|れいとう}⟦ピザ→ピザ：06769_piza⟧ (frozen pizza)\n- ⟦{急速|きゅうそく}→急速：02634_kyuusoku⟧{冷凍|れいとう} (flash freezing)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {冷凍|れいとう}: freezing (below 0°C), for long-term preservation\n- ⟦{冷蔵|れいぞう}→冷蔵：11731_reizou⟧: refrigeration (above 0°C), for short-term storage",
